config TEST_DRIVER_NO_CLOSE
	bool "Give the test HCI driver no close() op"
	help
	  Build the test HCI driver without a close() op, as several in-tree
	  HCI drivers are, so that bt_disable() cannot close the transport.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
